    "Lead submissions divided by measured profile requests. Requests are not unique people; repeated submissions can exceed 100%.": {
      "comment": "Public UI copy. Non-English translations are machine-assisted with agent corrections; human language review is pending. See docs/LOCALISATION.md.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lead-Übermittlungen im Verhältnis zu den gemessenen Profilanfragen. Anfragen entsprechen nicht einzelnen Personen; wiederholte Übermittlungen können zu Werten über 100 % führen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lead submissions divided by measured profile requests. Requests are not unique people; repeated submissions can exceed 100%."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envíos de contactos divididos por las solicitudes de perfil registradas. Las solicitudes no representan personas únicas; los envíos repetidos pueden superar el 100 %."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soumissions de prospects divisées par le nombre de consultations de profil mesurées. Les consultations ne correspondent pas à des personnes uniques ; les soumissions répétées peuvent dépasser 100 %."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invii di lead rapportati alle richieste di profilo rilevate. Le richieste non corrispondono a persone uniche; gli invii ripetuti possono superare il 100%."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リード送信数を、計測されたプロフィール閲覧リクエスト数で割った値です。リクエスト数はユニークユーザー数（個別の人数）ではないため、送信が繰り返されると100%を超える場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "리드 제출 수를 측정된 프로필 요청 수로 나눈 값입니다. 요청 수는 개별 사용자를 의미하는 것이 아니므로, 중복 제출로 인해 비율이 100%를 초과할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ingediende leads gedeeld door het aantal gemeten profielaanvragen. Aanvragen betreffen niet per se unieke personen; herhaalde inzendingen kunnen leiden tot een percentage van meer dan 100%."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envios de leads divididos pelas solicitações de perfil medidas. As solicitações não representam pessoas únicas; envios repetidos podem ultrapassar 100%."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "潜在客户提交数除以统计到的个人资料查看请求数。请求数不代表独立访客人数；重复提交可能导致比例超过 100%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
