    "Payment is charged to your Apple account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. Manage or cancel in your Apple account.": {
      "comment": "Public UI copy. Non-English translations are machine-assisted with agent corrections; human language review is pending. See docs/LOCALISATION.md.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Zahlung erfolgt über deinen Apple-Account. Abonnements verlängern sich automatisch, sofern sie nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vor Ablauf des aktuellen Zeitraums gekündigt werden. Du kannst das Abonnement in deinem Apple-Account verwalten oder kündigen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Payment is charged to your Apple account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the current period ends. Manage or cancel in your Apple account."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El pago se cargará a tu cuenta de Apple. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente a menos que se cancelen al menos 24 horas antes de que finalice el periodo actual. Gestiona o cancela la suscripción desde tu cuenta de Apple."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le paiement est débité de votre compte Apple. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement, sauf s’ils sont annulés au moins 24 heures avant la fin de la période en cours. Gérez ou annulez votre abonnement dans votre compte Apple."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo account Apple. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente a meno che non vengano annullati almeno 24 ore prima della fine del periodo corrente. Puoi gestire o annullare l'abbonamento nelle impostazioni del tuo account Apple."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支払いはAppleアカウントに請求されます。サブスクリプションは、現在の期間が終了する少なくとも24時間前までにキャンセルされない限り、自動的に更新されます。管理やキャンセルはAppleアカウントで行えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "결제는 Apple 계정으로 청구됩니다. 구독은 현재 기간이 종료되기 최소 24시간 전에 취소하지 않으면 자동으로 갱신됩니다. Apple 계정에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via uw Apple-account. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij ze ten minste 24 uur voor het einde van de huidige periode worden opgezegd. Beheer of annuleer uw abonnement via uw Apple-account."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O pagamento é cobrado na sua conta Apple. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período atual. Gerencie ou cancele na sua conta Apple."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "费用将从您的 Apple 账户扣除。除非在当前订阅期结束前至少 24 小时取消，否则订阅将自动续订。您可以在 Apple 账户中管理或取消订阅。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanently delete your account, cards and leads?": {
      "comment": "Public UI copy. Non-English translations are machine-assisted with agent corrections; human language review is pending. See docs/LOCALISATION.md.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
