    "Private contact fields stay out of public profiles and vCards. Anonymous views never identify visitors. Voice recognition runs on device; raw recordings are not retained.": {
      "comment": "Public UI copy. Non-English translations are machine-assisted with agent corrections; human language review is pending. See docs/LOCALISATION.md.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Private Kontaktfelder erscheinen nicht in öffentlichen Profilen oder vCards. Bei anonymen Aufrufen werden Besucher nicht identifiziert. Die Spracherkennung erfolgt direkt auf dem Gerät; Rohaufnahmen werden nicht gespeichert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Private contact fields stay out of public profiles and vCards. Anonymous views never identify visitors. Voice recognition runs on device; raw recordings are not retained."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los campos de contacto privados no aparecen en los perfiles públicos ni en las vCards. Las visualizaciones anónimas nunca identifican a los visitantes. El reconocimiento de voz se realiza en el dispositivo; no se conservan las grabaciones originales."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les champs de contact privés n’apparaissent pas sur les profils publics ni dans les vCards. Les consultations anonymes ne permettent jamais d’identifier les visiteurs. La reconnaissance vocale s’effectue sur l’appareil ; les enregistrements bruts ne sont pas conservés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I campi di contatto privati non vengono inclusi nei profili pubblici né nelle vCard. Le visualizzazioni anonime non identificano mai i visitatori. Il riconoscimento vocale avviene sul dispositivo; le registrazioni grezze non vengono conservate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非公開の連絡先情報は、公開プロフィールやvCardには含まれません。匿名での閲覧において、訪問者が特定されることはありません。音声認識はデバイス上で処理され、録音データそのものが保存されることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "비공개 연락처 정보는 공개 프로필이나 vCard에 표시되지 않습니다. 익명 조회 시 방문자의 신원은 식별되지 않습니다. 음성 인식은 기기 내에서 처리되며, 원본 녹음 파일은 저장되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privé-contactvelden worden niet opgenomen in openbare profielen en vCards. Bij anonieme weergaven worden bezoekers nooit geïdentificeerd. Spraakherkenning vindt plaats op het apparaat; ruwe opnames worden niet bewaard."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Campos de contato privados não aparecem em perfis públicos nem em vCards. Visualizações anônimas nunca identificam visitantes. O reconhecimento de voz é processado no dispositivo; gravações brutas não são armazenadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私密联系信息不会显示在公开资料或 vCard 中。匿名查看不会识别访客身份。语音识别在设备端进行，不会保留原始录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro is being prepared for release. Purchases stay disabled until server entitlement verification and the advertised features are verified.": {
      "comment": "Public UI copy. Non-English translations are machine-assisted with agent corrections; human language review is pending. See docs/LOCALISATION.md.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro wird für die Veröffentlichung vorbereitet. Käufe bleiben deaktiviert, bis die Berechtigungsprüfung auf dem Server und die beworbenen Funktionen verifiziert sind."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro is being prepared for release. Purchases stay disabled until server entitlement verification and the advertised features are verified."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se está preparando el lanzamiento de la versión Pro. Las compras permanecen deshabilitadas hasta que se verifiquen los derechos de acceso del servidor y las funciones anunciadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La version Pro est en cours de préparation. Les achats restent désactivés tant que la vérification des droits côté serveur et celle des fonctionnalités annoncées n'ont pas été effectuées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La versione Pro è in fase di preparazione per il rilascio. Gli acquisti rimangono disabilitati finché non vengono verificati i diritti lato server e le funzionalità pubblicizzate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro版のリリース準備中です。サーバー側での資格（エンタイトルメント）確認と、謳われている機能の検証が完了するまで、購入機能は無効のままとなります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro 버전 출시를 준비 중입니다. 서버 권한 확인 및 홍보된 기능에 대한 검증이 완료될 때까지 구매 기능이 비활성화 상태로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro wordt voorbereid voor de release. Aankopen blijven uitgeschakeld totdat de server-autorisatie en de geadverteerde functies zijn geverifieerd."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Pro está sendo preparado para lançamento. As compras permanecem desativadas até que a verificação de direitos no servidor e os recursos anunciados sejam validados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro 版本即将发布。在完成服务器端权限验证及确认相关功能可用之前，购买功能将保持禁用状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro purchases are not yet available. Release configuration and sandbox verification are required.": {
      "comment": "Public UI copy. Non-English translations are machine-assisted with agent corrections; human language review is pending. See docs/LOCALISATION.md.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro-Käufe sind noch nicht verfügbar. Eine Release-Konfiguration und eine Sandbox-Verifizierung sind erforderlich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro purchases are not yet available. Release configuration and sandbox verification are required."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las compras de la versión Pro aún no están disponibles. Se requieren la configuración de lanzamiento y la verificación en el entorno de pruebas (sandbox)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les achats « Pro » ne sont pas encore disponibles. La configuration de la version finale et la vérification en environnement de test (sandbox) sont requises."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gli acquisti della versione Pro non sono ancora disponibili. Sono necessari la configurazione di rilascio e la verifica in ambiente sandbox."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro版の購入はまだ利用できません。リリース設定とサンドボックス環境での検証が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro 구매는 아직 이용할 수 없습니다. 릴리스 구성 및 샌드박스 검증이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro-aankopen zijn nog niet beschikbaar. Een release-configuratie en verificatie in de sandbox zijn vereist."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As compras da versão Pro ainda não estão disponíveis. São necessárias a configuração de lançamento e a verificação em ambiente de teste (sandbox)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专业版购买功能暂不可用。需完成发布配置及沙盒环境验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
